          "start": 0
        },
        "quote": "(a) Operators must be at least 16 years of age. A driver’s license is not required.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.040 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "70a93f0e-99f2-569a-93db-30b8dfc1b9dc",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 183,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:1",
          "start": 84
        },
        "quote": "(b) Operators under the age of 18 shall wear a helmet while operating an electric-assisted scooter.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.040 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "6dea1ebe-cd60-5db3-bc44-c20445e3f7f9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 279,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:2",
          "start": 184
        },
        "quote": "(c) It shall be unlawful to fail to comply with all traffic regulations applicable to bicycles.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.040 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "2be4f961-534d-507c-9fe7-a0097a1f2dfd",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 405,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:3",
          "start": 280
        },
        "quote": "(d) Notwithstanding subsection (c) of this section, it shall be unlawful for the operator of an electric-assisted scooter to:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.040 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "ffbf4d43-1ad5-5f78-9614-f31dbd5347d0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 579,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:4",
          "start": 406
        },
        "quote": "(1) Operate an electric-assisted scooter on a street with a speed limit of 35 miles per hour or more unless the electric-assisted scooter is traveling in a marked bike lane;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.040 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "2728c75e-e73d-5e6f-9a4b-d3f5f7a4f196",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 663,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:5",
          "start": 580
        },
        "quote": "(2) Operate an electric-assisted scooter at a speed in excess of 15 miles per hour;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.040 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "547d908c-3561-5f17-9ee8-9856ce57c4d2",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 786,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:6",
          "start": 664
        },
        "quote": "(3) Fail to yield the right-of-way to pedestrians and/or give an audible signal before overtaking and passing pedestrians;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.040 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "0e3021d8-a60b-59ef-a74b-1e7e82237096",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 910,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:7",
          "start": 787
        },
        "quote": "(4) Fail to comply with Shawnee County resolutions governing County park property, including the regional multi-use trails;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.040 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "240e774b-a39b-582f-8685-f48c712a8715",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1013,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:8",
          "start": 911
        },
        "quote": "(5) Fail to remain alert and give full attention to the safe operation of the scooter while in motion;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.040 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "42110a9e-3ce8-5a0c-be08-14bd745243eb",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1099,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:9",
          "start": 1014
        },
        "quote": "(6) Engage in any activity that interferes with the safe operation of the scooter; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.040 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "fcee6279-a3cd-5f6a-95a8-f71c6b86eec0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1328,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:10",
          "start": 1100
        },
        "quote": "(7) Operate the electric-assisted scooter in such a manner as to indicate a careless or heedless disregard for the rights or safety of others, or in such a manner as to endanger, or be likely to endanger, any person or property.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.040 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "49cd92bd-9422-5e84-a952-df142d4a2ea0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1572,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:11",
          "start": 1329
        },
        "quote": "(e) The Municipal Judge shall establish a schedule of fines to be imposed for violations of this section. The fines shall not exceed the amount established for traffic infractions related to the operation of bicycles. (Ord. 20178 § 3, 4-9-19.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.040:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
